From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nivogli <224451320+nivogli@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:00:02 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Ignore TOP_OF_PIPE source and BOTTOM_OF_PIPE dest for kept
 barriers

TOP_OF_PIPE in a barrier's first synchronization scope and BOTTOM_OF_PIPE
in its second are equivalent to NONE, but MoltenVK maps both to every
stage. A compute barrier that also names one of them would therefore
never stay inside the compute encoder.

Adopted from https://github.com/nivogli/MoltenVK commit
71bf4b4e8ef666ac0811da99b05df6a0da1d05c3.

Modifications: none in behaviour. Only the decision to keep a barrier in
the compute encoder changes, as in that commit, so
MVK_PERF_KEEP_COMPUTE_ENCODER=0 also disables this. The fence path and
render pass dependencies still map these bits to every stage, which only
synchronizes more; the wider
https://github.com/KhronosGroup/MoltenVK/pull/2891 was not tested here.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 MoltenVK/MoltenVK/Commands/MVKCmdPipeline.mm | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/MoltenVK/MoltenVK/Commands/MVKCmdPipeline.mm b/MoltenVK/MoltenVK/Commands/MVKCmdPipeline.mm
index a2091cef..8b899657 100644
--- a/MoltenVK/MoltenVK/Commands/MVKCmdPipeline.mm
+++ b/MoltenVK/MoltenVK/Commands/MVKCmdPipeline.mm
@@ -167,8 +167,10 @@
 		uint64_t srcStages = 0, dstStages = 0;
 		bool touchesHost = false, coversIndirectArgs = false;
 		for (auto& b : _barriers) {
-			srcStages |= mvkBarrierStagesFromPipelineStageFlags(b.srcStageMask);
-			dstStages |= mvkBarrierStagesFromPipelineStageFlags(b.dstStageMask);
+			// TOP_OF_PIPE in the first scope and BOTTOM_OF_PIPE in the second are equivalent
+			// to NONE in Vulkan, but mvkBarrierStagesFromPipelineStageFlags() maps them to every stage.
+			srcStages |= mvkBarrierStagesFromPipelineStageFlags(b.srcStageMask & ~VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_TOP_OF_PIPE_BIT);
+			dstStages |= mvkBarrierStagesFromPipelineStageFlags(b.dstStageMask & ~VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_BOTTOM_OF_PIPE_BIT);
 			touchesHost |= mvkIsAnyFlagEnabled(b.srcStageMask | b.dstStageMask, VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_HOST_BIT);
 			coversIndirectArgs |= mvkIsAnyFlagEnabled(b.dstStageMask, VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_DRAW_INDIRECT_BIT | VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_ALL_COMMANDS_BIT);
 		}
